---
layout: base.njk
title: "Health Check-Up Plans — DHS Multispecialty Hospital Ahmedabad"
description: "Comprehensive health check-up plans at DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Ahmedabad. From basic screening to executive cardiac packages. Book your health check-up today."
canonical: "https://www.dhshospitals.com/health-check-up/"
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { name: "Health Check-Up Plans", url: "/health-check-up/" }
activePage: "health"
---

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Health Check-Up Plans</h1>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Health Check-Up Plans</div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-bottom:40px">We support your vision of a healthy future with our comprehensive health check-up plans. Health with Precision.</p>
    <div class="plans-grid">
      {% for plan in healthplans %}
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-card-header">
          <h3>{{ plan.name }}</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card-body">
          <ul>
            {% for test in plan.tests %}
            <li>{{ test }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px;padding:25px;background:var(--primary-light);border-radius:var(--radius)">
      <p style="margin-bottom:15px;font-size:1.05rem">To book a health check-up or enquire about pricing, contact us:</p>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phones.emergency }}" class="btn btn-primary">Call {{ site.phones.emergency }}</a>
      <a href="/appointment/" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-left:10px">Book Online</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
